PineAI module assets
====================

- `pineai_backend/` contains the standard-library-only Baseline & Drift
  resolver, private assessment store, deterministic finding engine, report
  generator, and optional non-authoritative OpenAI client.
- `pineai_cli.py` provides local administration, baseline, comparison,
  finding, privacy-preview, AI-analysis, and report commands.

Runtime state is stored under `/root/.PineAI/` with private permissions. Raw
Hak5 Recon responses are processed in memory and are not persisted. Real SSIDs
and BSSIDs remain local; BSSIDs and MAC addresses are never sent to an AI
provider, and SSID sharing is opt-in.

See `docs/backend-api.md`, `docs/frontend.md`, and
`docs/product-direction.md` in the source repository.
